<section class="panel">
  <div class="section-heading">
    <p class="eyebrow">Why it works</p>
    <h2>Designed for recording in the apps you already use.</h2>
  </div>
  <div class="feature-grid">
    <article>
      <span class="feature-kicker">Floating mode</span>
      <h3>Keep your script above camera, video, and meeting apps.</h3>
      <p>Read while the recording app stays open, so you do not need to switch screens mid-take.</p>
    </article>
    <article>
      <span class="feature-kicker">On-camera delivery</span>
      <h3>Stay closer to the lens and keep the take moving.</h3>
      <p>Use a readable overlay to reduce pauses, glances away, and awkward restarts.</p>
    </article>
    <article>
      <span class="feature-kicker">Remote control</span>
      <h3>Adjust speed from Apple Watch or another device.</h3>
      <p>When the setup needs it, control playback without touching the recording screen.</p>
    </article>
  </div>
</section>
